m_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/39f96d99e6fc79cd950b3246673580b9.webm?t=1771873418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's next?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll be adding new content, fixes, and improvements over time. If you’ve got ideas, suggestions or find any bugs, let me know! Your feedback really helps make the game better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sculpt sand to create winding streams through lush forests and rolling meadows. Babbling Brook is a cozy &amp; relaxing indie game about messing around with water and sand. Also, there's a flock of rubber ducks trying to escape to the open sea...", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/ec32d6a83b5955946cd23501a3ac2d4a99868b70/header.jpg?t=1771873418", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/6a03934676695e7de5fa372980268d6091f3de06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771873418", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/6a03934676695e7de5fa372980268d6091f3de06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771873418", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with